data: {"query":"他有哪些论文","query_type":"canonical_v2:A:answer","answer_text":"你问的“他”指向的是这篇论文《Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect》的作者之一。从公开信息看，这位作者（Yong Yao）参与的光纤传感与光子学方向论文主要有以下几篇：\n\n- 《Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect》，与 Mingran Quan、Jiajun Tian 合作，2015 年发表于 Optics Letters。该工作提出一种基于光子晶体光纤与 Vernier 效应的开放式法布里–珀罗干涉仪气体折射率传感器，实测折射率灵敏度可达 30899 nm/RIU。\n- 《High-sensitivity relative humidity fiber-optic sensor based on an internal–external Fabry–Perot cavity Vernier effect》，与 Cheng Zhou、Qian Zhou、Bo Wang、Jiajun Tian 合作，2021 年发表于 Optics Express。该传感器利用内外法布里–珀罗腔 Vernier 效应配合壳聚糖薄膜，在 40%–92% RH 范围内灵敏度达 7.15 nm/% RH。\n- 《Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer》，与 Q. Zhang、Jun‐Jun Xiao、X. M. Zhang、Hui Liu 合作，2013 年发表于 Optics Express。研究金纳米棒异二聚体在偶极–四极 Fano 共振附近光学结合力的反转现象。\n- 《An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure》，与 Hucheng Xie、Yingjie Liu、Yuhan Wang、Yujie Wang、Qinghai Song 合作，2020 年发表于 IEEE Photonics Technology Letters。器件尺寸仅 4 × 4.5 μm²，可对 TE₀、TE₁、TE₂ 三种模式直接分光。\n- 《High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm》，与 Xi Wang、Weihong Shen、Wenxiang Li、Yingjie Liu、Jiangbing Du 合作，2021 年发表于 Photonics Research。该硅基马赫–曾德尔调制器面向 2 μm 波段，采用 PAM-4 格式时调制速率可达 80 Gbit/s。\n\n以上是当前可确认的、与该论文作者直接相关的成果。如果你关注的是其中某位具体作者（如 Jiajun Tian 或 Yong Yao）的完整论文列表，可以告诉我，我再针对该人做进一步梳理。","citations":[{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","label":"Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.40.004891"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","label":"Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.21.006601"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","label":"An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/lpt.2020.2975128"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1","label":"High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/prj.417107"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-eeb260ab2b702a8a","label":"High-sensitivity relative humidity fiber-optic sensor based on an internal–external Fabry–Perot cavity Vernier effect","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.421060"}],"evidence":[],"clarification":null,"structured_payload":{},"answer_style":"llm_synthesized","citation_map":{"1":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","2":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","3":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","4":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1","5":"official-source-eeb260ab2b702a8a"},"suggested_followups":[]}

